X: 153
T: To Avert From Men God's Wrath
%%combinevoices 1
C: Words: Latin c. 1400, sometimes attr. John Hus.  Translated Christian Ignatius Latrobe, 1789. 
C: Music: 'Gethsemane' or 'Petra' Richard Redhead, 1853. 
